OL,3,GNEWSARoad partially reopens after hotel
OL,4,Aceiling collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FA road that was closed due to
OL,7,Fstructural damage at a hotel has
OL,8,Fpartially reopened.
OL,10,FThe Bear Hotel in Wareham, Dorset, was
OL,11,Fevacuated on Sunday when part of the
OL,12,Fceiling and masonry came down in one of
OL,13,Fits bedrooms, leading to fears of
OL,14,Ffurther collapse.
OL,16,FSouth Street was closed to traffic
OL,17,Fwhile structural engineers made the
OL,18,Fscene safe with scaffolding and
OL,19,Fbarriers.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
