OL,3,GNEWSARoad partially reopens after hotel
OL,4,Aceiling collapse
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne lane of the road opened on
OL,7,FWednesday afternoon with temporary
OL,8,Ftraffic lights. The pavement opposite
OL,9,Fthe hotel also reopened.
